        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions RD1-Ax-CAB/3 Modern Acrylic Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese all new modern rectangular cabinet knobs are hand made in the USA by the master craftsmen at First Impressions from the finest acrylic available. The  acrylic is manufacture with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading and available in your choice of Crystal Clear or Frosted.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe retro-modern design of these space age acrylic cabinet handles is really stunning. Our pictures do not do them justice. The are available with Polished Chrome or Satin Nickel mounting brackets. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/modern-acrylic-8-inch-cabinet-handle-first-impressions-cb-yrk1008acbal\"><b>Acrylic Cabinet Pulls</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/9-inch-modern-acrylic-shower-door-handle-set-first-impressions-sd-yrk01009acbal\"><b>Shower Door Handles</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions RD1-Ax-CAB/3 Modern  Cabinet Knob\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Acrylic Handle Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Handle Thickness: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Clearance: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Bracket Finishes: 2</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\"  thick  cabinet door or drawer.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
